  "name": "Groq",
  "label": "Groq",
  "description": "Official Groq Cloud OpenAI-compatible API (chat, STT, TTS, list models) on the v2 agent model contract (INPUT llm_input → OUTPUT llm_output). Auth is StudioQuack secret api_key sent as Authorization Bearer. reasoning_format / include_reasoning pass through; Groq raw-default reasoning families (qwen/*, *qwq*, deepseek-r1-distill-*) auto-get reasoning_format=parsed so reasoning streams on the thinking channel (gpt-oss already streams a reasoning field by default). Audio uses type file (platform ref-id). Docs: https://console.groq.com/docs/api-reference. Terms: https://console.groq.com/docs/legal/services-agreement. Never log api_key.",
  "icon": "psychology",
  "tags": [
    "groq",
